The files in this folder are derived from Meta's SAM 3D Body
(https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam-3d-body) and its annotations
(https://huggingface.co/datasets/facebook/sam-3d-body-dataset):

  mhr_cont_head.npz      extracted from the SAM 3D Body checkpoint
  mhr_landmarks70.npz    extracted from the SAM 3D Body checkpoint
  mhr_j127_to_kp70.npy   fitted to the SAM 3D Body annotations
  mhr_size_bounds.npz    measured on the SAM 3D Body annotations
  adapter_j14_h36m.npz   fitted to the SAM 3D Body annotations

They are distributed under the SAM License, not under the repository's
Apache-2.0 licence. The full text is in LICENSE-SAM at the repository root.
